### 1. Richiesta reset — copia il "devToken" dalla risposta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "tester_t7@example.com" }

### 2. Reimposta (incolla il token del passo 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "Sm1pHalq81JfP12JHa21-ijzO3iiFSC8zyRnGUCW_DI", "newPassword": "nuovaPassword123" }

### 3. Login con la nuova password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "tester_t7", "password": "nuovaPassword123" }